                                    <h2 class="fw-bold text-primary">Hey There! Ready to Learn Generics? 📦</h2>
                                    <p class="fs-5">
                                        <strong>Generics</strong> sounds fancy, but it's actually <strong>super simple</strong>!
                                        It lets you write code that works with <strong>any type</strong> of data,
                                        while keeping everything <strong>safe</strong> and <strong>organized</strong>.
                                    </p>
                                    <div class="alert alert-success mt-3">
                                        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb me-2"></i>
                                        <strong>Quick Question:</strong> Have you ever used a <strong>container</strong>?
                                        <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                                            <li>📦 A box can hold <strong>books</strong>, <strong>toys</strong>, or <strong>clothes</strong></li>
                                            <li>📦 The box is the <strong>same</strong> - what's inside <strong>changes</strong></li>
