                                        <ul class="mt-2">
                                            <li>✅ Explain generics like a pro (but in simple words)</li>
                                            <li>✅ Create generic classes (reusable containers)</li>
                                            <li>✅ Use generic methods (flexible functions)</li>
                                            <li>✅ Add constraints (rules for what types can be used)</li>
